Q: WAP to Append Strings:
package string_builder;

public class String_Builder {

    
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        //Declaration
        StringBuilder sb=new StringBuilder("H");
        sb.append("e");
        sb.append("l");
        sb.append("l");
        sb.append("o");
        System.out.println("The String is " + sb);
    }
}

OUTPUT:
The String is Hello

